# Dense AI-pairing rationale/incident-history docs, kept on disk for local
# development. CLAUDE.local.md is a Claude Code-recognized filename that
# auto-loads alongside CLAUDE.md in the same directory -- see
# https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory.md. The lean CLAUDE.md files stay
# tracked; these do not.
